+# Proposal
+
+## Why
+
+The desk needs to see at a glance what can still be rented for a given period, instead of trying `book` item by item.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `availability(query)` to the rental service, with `query` of the form `{ start, end, kind? }`.
+- It returns the sorted ids of the equipment of that kind (any kind when `kind` is omitted) that is free for the whole period.
+- It is read-only: nothing is reserved.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+- `equipment-rental`: adds an availability query requirement.
+
+## Impact
+
+`src/index.ts` (`RentalService` interface and `createRentalService`) and `src/index.test.ts`. No dependency or breaking change.
